# Line endings are normalized to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform, so the
# toolchain (prettier `endOfLine: lf`, deterministic builds) behaves identically on Windows, macOS,
# and Linux. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` checkouts render tracked files CRLF locally and fail
# `format:check` while the committed blobs remain LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
